# Regenerate all demos: npm run demo
Output demo/paths.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 880
Set Height 420
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 75ms

Hide
Type `. demo/setup.sh && cd "$HOME" && clear`
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

# map a directory to an account: p expands, "+ add path" edits inline
Type "claudes"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Type "p"
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "/dev/personal"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
